/T (People The people of New Zealand, affectionately known as Kiwis, embody a unique blend of warmth, inclusivity, and a love for the great outdoors. They are renowned for their friendliness, making visitors feel right at home with their open and welcoming nature.)
/E (People The people of New Zealand, affectionately known as Kiwis, embody a unique blend of warmth, inclusivity, and a love for the great outdoors. They are renowned for their friendliness, making visitors feel right at home with their open and welcoming nature.)
