<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Kiwis have a relaxed and easy-going attitude, prioritizing work-life balance and relishing the abundant natural beauty that surrounds them. Their appreciation for the environment also shines through in their efforts to protect and preserve the country's natural heritage, making New Zealand a nation that values both its people and the planet.)
/E (Kiwis have a relaxed and easy-going attitude, prioritizing work-life balance and relishing the abundant natural beauty that surrounds them. Their appreciation for the environment also shines through in their efforts to protect and preserve the country's natural heritage, making New Zealand a nation that values both its people and the planet.)
