/T (The Tiaki Promise includes a set of guiding principles, such as showing respect to the land, sea, and nature; traveling safely and responsibly; respecting cultural differences and traditions; and being mindful of the environment and its conservation. It emphasizes the importance of taking care of New Zealand's pristine landscapes for future generations.)
/E (The Tiaki Promise includes a set of guiding principles, such as showing respect to the land, sea, and nature; traveling safely and responsibly; respecting cultural differences and traditions; and being mindful of the environment and its conservation. It emphasizes the importance of taking care of New Zealand's pristine landscapes for future generations.)
