413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Immigration New Zealand has a very comprehensive website to support applicants with selecting and applying for the correct work visa.  Te Whatu Ora also provides a free immigration service run by qualified immigration advisors. Further information can be found here: https://www.tewhatuora.govt.nz/whats-happening/work-underway/international-recruitment-centre/)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
