/S /P
/ActualText (Shipping belongings)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Te Whatu Ora supports candidates with the costs of shipping essential items from their country of origin to New Zealand. There are several international removal companies depending on where in the world you are coming from. You should get quotes from at least two companies  before making a decision. Te Whatu Ora will require a copy of the invoice which must be no more than the amount stated in your bond agreement \(refer to your job offer\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
417 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Temporary accommodation)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
418 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (All new employees relocating from overseas will be offered a temporary accommodation package. Te Whatu Ora will provide  support in finding suitable accommodation on a case by case basis to meet yours/and your families needs. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
