/ActualText (Relocating to New Zealand with children)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
421 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1080 0 R
/ActualText (Relocating to New Zealand with children can be an incredibly exciting time. With its high standard of education, low crime rates, clean air and focus on sports and outdoor living,  New Zealand ticks all the boxes when it comes to finding the perfect place to raise a family.   )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
422 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
