508 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You can open a bank account in NZ before you travel but will need to visit a branch to activate it once you arrive. You need a visa that allows you to stay in the country such as a work, residence, or student visa.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
509 0 obj
<<
