531 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To register to pay tax in New Zealand, you need to apply for an IRD number.  Without this, you will not be able to receive any salary payments.  )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The easiest and fastest way for you to obtain an IRD tax number is to apply to the AA. The AA has been appointed by the Inland Revenue to accept individual IRD number applications.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You can apply in person at an AA Driver Licensing Agent. You can fill out the application form and bring the required documents to your local agent. Our staff will submit your application to Inland Revenue. The AA has close to 100 licensing agents around New Zealand.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
534 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You can apply online through the Inland Revenue website. Please note that you will still need to come to an AA Driver Licensing Agent with the required identification documents to have them verified within 60 days of your online application.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (How much does it cost?)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
536 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The express service costs $10 and guarantees that you get an IRD number within 4 working days. If you do not pay the express fee, it takes approximately 3 weeks for your IRD number to come through.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
