/K [5]
>>
endobj
586 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Having a place to call home plays a significant role in establishing a sense of belonging in a new country, and the process of finding the perfect home for you and your family may require some time and consideration. We believe it's advisable to start by renting, even if your ultimate goal is to purchase a property. Renting allows you the opportunity to explore the available housing options and decide where you'd like to settle before making a long-term commitment.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
