718 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Cost of living)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
719 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The cost of living in Aotearoa, New Zealand can vary significantly depending on the city and region, but it is generally considered relatively high. Major cities like Auckland and Wellington tend to have higher living expenses, particularly in terms of housing, which can be a significant portion of one's budget.  However, it's worth noting that New Zealand offers a high quality of life, beautiful natural landscapes, and a strong social welfare system that includes public healthcare and education. Wages in New Zealand are also competitive, making it an attractive destination for expatriates and immigrants despite the higher cost of living.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
