725 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In New Zealand, there are several supermarkets offering a variety of products at different price points. Here are some of the major supermarkets in Wellington along with a brief overview of their offerings and general price ranges:)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
726 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Countdown: Countdown is one of the largest supermarket chains in New Zealand, offering a wide range of groceries, fresh produce, meat, dairy, and household items. Price Range: Countdown typically offers a mix of budget-friendly and premium products to cater to different customer preferences and budgets. Prices may vary depending on the specific products and promotions available. )
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
727 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (New World: New World supermarkets are known for their focus on fresh produce, gourmet foods, and specialty items. They offer a wide selection of groceries, including organic and locally sourced products. Price Range: While New World tends to offer high-quality products, prices can vary depending on the brand and type of product. Some items may be more expensive compared to other supermarket chains due to their focus on specialty and premium goods.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
